# "If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell or ability tries to resolve, it won't resolve. You won't empower
# Jace" (the ruling; CR 608.2b). Bot1 casts Countersculpt at Bot2's Lightning Bolt, then Counterspell at it too; Counterspell
# resolves first and counters the Bolt, so Countersculpt's only target is gone: it does nothing and no Jace token is made.

